WEBVTT

00:08:30.236 --> 00:08:33.756
“What should I do with my clock?”
asks the boy, picking it up.

00:08:34.116 --> 00:08:35.716
Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock.

00:08:36.516 --> 00:08:40.196
But now the sound
of the loom is getting louder.

00:08:40.756 --> 00:08:42.796
Dahganah, denah, dahganah,

00:08:42.796 --> 00:08:45.716
dahganah, denah, dahganah, goes the loom.

00:08:46.876 --> 00:08:48.076
“Throw it in!”

00:08:48.756 --> 00:08:51.156
So the boy picks up the clock

00:08:51.156 --> 00:08:53.316
and tosses it into the loom.

00:08:54.516 --> 00:08:56.556
When it hits the tapestry,

00:08:56.556 --> 00:08:57.756
it breaks up.

00:08:58.196 --> 00:09:01.636
A fountain of silver glitter
scatters over the weaving.